Also check stage-group import still used elsewhere in about page? It's used only as PageHeader background. And chapterAudience used in aside AND maybe elsewhere in about? Search within file: "chapterAudience" line 4 import, used at aside and maybe elsewhere. Also chapterLecture used somewhere later. Removing import if unused elsewhere.

